  "description": "MonoGame Content Builder (MGCB) content-processor plugin for ShadowDusk: compiles .fx to .xnb natively in MGCB's own process, with no mgfxc, no fxc.exe, and no Wine. A delivery shape of the ShadowDusk compiler library - it adds no compilation logic and emits byte-for-byte the same .mgfx the ShadowDusk CLI does.",
